QuestGuidance.Register("en",171,{
[5441]="7002EF50\n1\tTalk to Hestil\tHestil is by her camp near Parth Galen, in the East Wall. Rodwen has introduced herself to you, and recommended that you speak with Hestil if you are interested in helping her unfortunate band of adventurers.\n",
[5442]="7006C08A\n1\tTBD tell a story about the ritual\030TBD go to the first spot\tTBD Complete the ritual\n2\tTBD calm the oasis down metaphorically\030TBD go to the second ritual spot\tTBD Go to the next spot in the ritual\n3\tTBD express gratitude in the ritual\030TBD go to the final ritual spot\tTBD do the final part of the ritual\n4\tTBD Return to the Kintai\tTBD return to the fading kintai\n",
[5443]="70058CF7\n1\tAid Nagli Want-kin with 'A Beloved Friend'\030Aid Bráthur with 'The Slow Hunt'\030Aid Dúghild with 'Built from Nothing'\030Aid Gaustaf with 'Greylin's Bounty'\tBráthur, Dúghild, Gaustaf, and Nagli Want-kin can be found at Khadâsh-gâra in Elderslade. Nagli Want-kin has invited you to share in a day of the simple life he and the other Want-kin have long sought. You should speak to the Want-kin.\n2\tTalk to Nagli Want-kin\tNagli Want-kin can be found at Khadâsh-gâra in Elderslade. You have shared in a day in the life of the Want-kin. You should talk to Nagli Want-kin.\n",
[5444]="7005332C\n1\tRepair the birdhouses of Rhosgobel (total: 10)\tBirdhouses can be found at Rhosgobel in Laerlad. You should repair birdhouses for Radagast.\n2\tTalk to Radagast\tRadagast can be found at Rhosgobel. You should talk to Radagast.\n",
[5445]="70044D65\n1\tCollect Tunglewort (total: 5)\030Collect Maiden's Helm (total: 5)\030Collect Wanderbeard (total: 5)\030Collect Settlegang (total: 5)\tTunglewort can be found in Osgiliath near the Anduin. Maiden's Helm can be found in the northern woods of Lossarnach. Wanderbeard can be found at the base of the mountains in Pelennor. Settlegang can be found in the woods of Talath Anor. You should seek out these particular plants for Galathir.\n2\tSpeak with Galathir\tGalathir can be found in the Houses of Healing on the southern end of the Sixth Circle. You should speak with Galathir.\n3\tGrind up the herbs with the mortar and pestle\tThe mortar and pestle can be found near Galathir in the Houses of Healing. You should grind the herbs with the mortar and pestle.\n4\tGrind up the herbs a little more\tThe mortar and pestle can be found near Galathir in the Houses of Healing. You should grind the herbs with the mortar and pestle.\n5\tSpeak with Galathir\tGalathir can be found in the Houses of Healing on the southern end of the Sixth Circle. You should speak with Galathir.\n",
[5446]="70068368\n1\tCollect wild hog haunches ([see journal]/12)\tWhile you hunt the crags and other areas of the eastern cape of Umbar, Abido asked that you collect wild hog haunches to help feed the masses in the city.\n2\tYou collected enough haunches to satisfy Abido's needs. Return the haunches to him at the hunter's expedition in the south-east of the Cape of Umbar.\t\n",
[5447]="7004E988\n1\tGet the potion from Radagast\tYou should return to Radagast, in the Thornholt woods, to collect the potion which will guard against the Ungoladan-poison.\n2\tReturn to Threkmóth\tYou should return once again to the Beorning camp of Skoghús, in the south of Thornholt, and let Threkmóth know you have Radagast's potion.\n3\tDeliver Radagast's potion to Fiskvat\030Deliver Radagast's potion to Hunulf\tYou should deliver the poison protection to Fiskvat and Hunulf, Threkmóth's neighbours.\n4\tReturn to Threkmóth\tYou should return to Threkmóth, now that you have given Radagast's potion to Fiskvat and Hunulf.\n",
[5448]="70000614\n1\tAsk Radagast to purify the water\030Collect an urn of pure water from Radagast\tRadagast is within his tower in the Eglan-camp in Agamaur. Dannasen instructed you to present the full Urn of Agamaur to Radagast the Brown and ask him to purify the water within so you might restore the Red-maid.\n2\tTalk to Dannasen at the Eglan-camp\030Collect Pure Water\tDannasen is at the Eglan-camp in Agamaur. You should return to Dannasen and tell him that Radagast has purified the water from Agamaur with a sister's love.\n",
[5449]="7004955C\n1\tCollect supplies at Orodir (total: 8)\030Collect rations at Orodir (total: 8)\tOrodir is located next to Naerband. You should collect supplies and rations for the Nurnhoth.\n2\tTalk to Akhrûn\tAkhrûn can be found just outside of Orodir, next to Naerband. You should speak with Akhrûn.\n",
[5450]="70026936\n1\tFind Dunstan and his company\tDunstan and his company is abroad in the Heathfells. Grimbold asked you to find Dunstan and his company so that you can deliver the Rohirrim lord's orders requesting the young warrior's return to the Ford of Isen.\n",
[5451]="7001B6EB\n1\tForay Against the Sorcerers\t\n",
[5452]="70046C24\n1\tFill a water-skin in the Forbidden Pool\030Fill a water-skin in the eastern reaches of the stream of Henneth Annûn\030Fill a water-skin in the western reaches of the stream of Henneth Annûn\tThe stream of Henneth Annûn passes over the refuge from the east, and flows westward through the Field of Cormallen. Laeglaw has asked you to gather water from various points of the stream of Henneth Annûn in order to determine if the Enemy's forces have poisoned it.\n2\tDeliver the water-skins to Laeglaw at Henneth Annûn\tLaeglaw can be found in Henneth Annûn. You have filled water-skins at various points along the stream of Henneth Annûn and should now return to Laeglaw.\n",
[5453]="70017594\n1\tTalk to Mosco Mudbottom at Ost Guruth\tMosco Mudbottom can be found at Ost Guruth in the Lone-lands, far to the north and west of Moria. Sadreda has instructed you to speak with a warden by the name of Mosco Mudbottom.\n",
[5454]="700082EF\n1\tBring goblin slave-collars to Elúr\030Collect goblin slave-collars (total: 8)\tGoblins can be found on the outskirts of the Orc-encampment at Dol Dínen, south-east of Esteldín. According to Elúr, the goblins of the North Downs have been forced into servitude by the Orcs of Angmar and act as the advance forces of the Orc-host. The Ranger has asked you to dispose of the goblins, bringing him their slave collars as evidence that you have completed your task.\n",
[5455]="7005873D\n1\tDefeat the forces of Gundabad upon the battlefield (total: 15)\tThe forces of Gundabad can be found upon the battlefield. You should defeat any of the forces of Gundabad you find upon the battlefield.\n2\tCompleted\tDefeated many of the forces of Gundabad upon the battlefield.\n",
[5456]="70058749\n1\tDefeat the forces of Gundabad upon the battlefield (total: 20)\tThe forces of Gundabad can be found upon the battlefield. You should defeat any of the forces of Gundabad you find upon the battlefield.\n2\tCompleted\tDefeated many of the forces of Gundabad upon the battlefield.\n",
[5457]="70058746\n1\tDefeat the forces of Gundabad upon the battlefield (total: 15)\tThe forces of Gundabad can be found upon the battlefield. You should defeat any of the forces of Gundabad you find upon the battlefield.\n2\tCompleted\tDefeated many of the forces of Gundabad upon the battlefield.\n",
[5458]="7004B2E1\n1\tDefeat Anglach Hammerer (quantity: see journal)\030Defeat Goblin Forgeworkers (total: 5)\030Defeat Mordor Warrior (total: 5)\030Defeat Mordor Archer (total: 5)\tThe Captain of the Pit's forces can be found within Anglach: The Great Foundry. You should defeat Orcs, trolls, and goblins within Anglach.\n",
[5459]="700173CA\n1\tDefeat White Hand Pummellers (total: 5)\030Defeat White Hand Shields (total: 5)\030Defeat White Hand Arrows (total: 5)\tWhite Hand Orcs can be found in the Grand Stair, north-east of the Orc-watch. Thithrand mentioned that the White Hand Orcs found in the Grand Stair are lesser images of their leaders, and that there is a good number of the foe within. You should use caution when you face them.\n2\tTalk to Thithrand at the Orc-watch\tThithrand is at the Orc-watch, south-west of the Grand Stair. You should return to Thithrand with news of your successes.\n",
[5460]="70029FBC\n1\tComplete 'Ford of Bruinen' in a raid group\tThe Ford of Bruinen is the last bulwark leading into the hidden vale of Rivendell. Orcs in the service of Angmar lay siege at the Ford, seeking to break through the defences of Imladris.\n",
[5461]="700174FB\n1\tTalk to Foreman Indrith in the Wheel-house\tForeman Indrith is in the Wheel-house, beneath the Great Wheel, south-west of Hulwul-nefekh. Ansurr suggested to seek out Foreman Indrith and aid him however you may.\n",
[5462]="70007577\n1\tDefeat bats in the western Old Forest (total: 12)\tThere is a tunnel into the Old Forest, east of Hodric Bracegirdle. Hodric Bracegirdle has asked you to reduce the number of bats in the Old Forest.\n2\tTalk to Hodric Bracegirdle in Buckland\tHodric Bracegirdle can be found near the entrance to the Old Forest near the hole in the High Hay. Hodric awaits word of your success.\n",
[5463]="70007578\n1\tDefeat bears in the western Old Forest (total: 12)\tThe bears can be found in the Old Forest, east of his location near the High Hay. Look for the tunnel to the east. Brumbald Tunnelly has asked you to help lessen the threat of bears.\n2\tTalk to Brumbald Tunnelly\tBrumbald Tunnelly can be found near the entrance to the Old Forest by the High Hay. He has asked you to help end the threat of bears in the Old Forest.\n",
[5464]="7001AA7B\n1\tPatrol the forest north of Emyn Lûm and ensure waypoints are clear of enemies (0/4)\tThe Elf waypoint can be found marked by a stone to the north of Emyn Lûm. You should scout the first waypoint of the patrol that Fuirgam has asked you to undertake and defeat any Orcs you might find there.\n2\tPatrol the forest north-east of Emyn Lûm and ensure waypoints are clear of enemies (1/4)\tThe Elf waypoint can be found marked by a stone to the north-east of Emyn Lûm. You should scout the second waypoint of the patrol that Fuirgam has asked you to undertake and defeat any Orcs you might find there.\n3\tPatrol the forest east of Emyn Lûm and ensure waypoints are clear of enemies (2/4)\tThe Elf waypoint can be found marked by a stone to the east of Emyn Lûm. You should scout the third waypoint of the patrol that Fuirgam has asked you to undertake and defeat any Orcs you might find there.\n4\tPatrol the forest south-east of Emyn Lûm and ensure waypoints are clear of enemies (3/4)\tThe Elf waypoint can be found marked by a stone to the south-east of Emyn Lûm. You should scout the fourth waypoint of the patrol that Fuirgam has asked you to undertake and defeat any Orcs you might find there.\n5\tTalk to Fuirgam at Ost Galadh\tFuirgam is at Ost Galadh. You should return to Fuirgam and report in.\n",
[5465]="7002CE24\n1\tTalk to Ordhrien\tYou should speak with Galadriel's envoys in the Limlight Gorge. Captain Agelbrit says the Elves were last seen headed down towards the far end of the Gorge.\n2\tTalk to Thickbark\tYou should ask the Ents of Fangorn what troubles have beset them recently.\n3\tTalk to Greylimb\tGreylimb waits with Thickbark beside the river. You should speak with Greylimb about his illness.\n4\tTalk to Erymeldir\tErymeldir waits beside the river. You should speak with Erymeldir and learn if he knows a remedy for the Ents and their trees.\n",
[5466]="70007579\n1\tDefeat spiders in the western and southern Old Forest (total: 24)\tThere is a tunnel into the Old Forest, east of his location near the High Hay. Search for the tunnel into the woods to the east. Hodric Bracegirdle has asked for your help defending against spiders in the Old Forest.\n2\tTalk to Hodric Bracegirdle\tHodric Bracegirdle can be found between the stable and the entrance to the Old Forest in Buckland. Hodric Bracegirdle awaits word of your success.\n",
[5467]="7000757A\n1\tDefeat wolves in the western Old Forest (total: 12)\tThere is a tunnel into the Old Forest, east of his location between the High Hay and the stables. Berangar Highknoll has asked you to help reduce the number of wolves in the Old Forest.\n2\tTalk to Berangar Highknoll\tBerangar Highknoll can be found near the entrance to the Old Forest between the High Hay and the stables in Buckland. Berangar Highknoll awaits word of your success.\n",
[5468]="70035CC0\n1\tTalk to Barallas outside Drû Vádokan\tBarallas can be found outside Drû Vádokan. Barallas has rallied the Ents of Balewood and they journey to his side. You should speak to him when you are ready to begin the assault.\n2\tTalk to Barallas\tBarallas can be found at Stonecliff in northern Balewood. You have defeated the vile Uruk, Voskor and brought a moment of peace to the Balewood. You should speak to Barallas of your victory.\n",
[5469]="70054F05\n1\tDefeat huorn-wights in Thuringwath (total: 12)\tHuorn-wights can be found within the white forest of Thuringwath. You should defeat the huorn-wights lurking within Thuringwath.\n2\tCompleted\tYou have defeated many huorn-wights in Thuringwath.\n",
[5470]="700359AE\n1\tCut firewood for the people of Wildermore (quantity: see journal)\tHildelith has given you a recipe for firewood. You should cut firewood for the people of Wildermore, so that they may stay warm at night.\n2\tDeliver the firewood to Hildelith\tHildelith is in Forlaw. You have cut some firewood and should now deliver it to Hildelith.\n",
[5471]="700187E2\n1\tTalk to Bennt Sharp-eye in the Dolven-view\030Talk to Thettmárr in the Deep Descent\tBennt Sharp-eye is in the Dolven-view, far to the east of Durin's Threshold, in the Great Delving. Stíling is in the Deep Descent, among the Silvertine Lodes, south of the Dolven-view. Tulk has asked you to provide assistance to the dwarves at Durin's Threshold, the Dolven-view, and the Deep Descent.\n2\tTalk to Bósi in the Chamber of the Cross-roads, on Durin's Way\tBósi has established a command centre somewhere within Moria and is waiting to speak with you there. The Dwarves of Moria will be able to guide you to Bósi's new command centre, a guard room with a strategic location somewhere within the mines.\n",
[5472]="70000171\n1\tTalk to Strider\tStrider's room in The Prancing Pony Inn in Bree can be found by heading left down the hall out of the common room, until you can only bear right. Strider's room is to the right of the stairs at the end of the hall. Barliman explained that a Ranger, Strider, was in a room in the Prancing Pony. He directed from the main bar to follow the hall left to the top of the stair, look for a short hall and door on the right and you should find Strider.\n",
})
